[Info]
Name	Kingdoms Fall
Description	The largest of them: seven rival keepers, no allies, and one crossroads. Skirmish, 7 opponents. Somewhere in the rock, veterans of an old hero company camp in a ruin, sitting on the gold they took with them.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

